Description: elementary's dock with folder stacks and zoom
 elementary's dock with three additions: macOS-style folder stacks
 (Downloads fanned out newest first, Applications as a grid), magnification
 under the pointer, and icons that stay sharp while zoomed or tilted.
 .
 It replaces io.elementary.dock, and satisfies what depends on it.
